<p class="govuk-body">A tag may be used to check that you are not leaving the area. This means you will also have to follow the rules for wearing a tag.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">If you need to go somewhere outside of the area in the map or mentioned in the map description, ask for permission from <a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_restriction_probation_officer_link">your probation officer</a> first.</p>
